{"seq":2,"slug":"hyperparameter-tuning","title":"超参数调优策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation/hyperparameter-tuning","wordCount":1076,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"超参数调优策略\">超参数调优策略</h1><p>LoRA 微调的超参数空间虽然比全量微调小得多，但错误的配置仍然会导致训练完全失败——学习率差两个数量级就可能在&quot;完全不学习&quot;和&quot;剧烈震荡&quot;之间切换。2026 年的最佳实践已经收敛出一组针对不同场景的推荐配置，将超参调优从盲目搜索变为有据可依的工程决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLM 微调的超参数可分为三层：模型侧（LoRA 配置）、优化器侧（学习率/调度）、训练侧（batch size/epoch）。三层之间存在强耦合关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 模型侧&#10;        R[rank] --- AL[alpha]&#10;        TM[target_modules] --- DO[dropout]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 优化器侧&#10;        LR[学习率] --- SC[调度器]&#10;        WR[warmup_ratio] --- WD[weight_decay]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 训练侧&#10;        BS[batch_size] --- GA[gradient_accumulation]&#10;        EP[epochs] --- ML[max_seq_length]&#10;    end&#10;    R --&gt;|rank↑ → LR 可适当↓| LR&#10;    BS --&gt;|BS↑ → LR 应适当↑| LR&#10;    EP --&gt;|EP↑ → 过拟合风险↑| DO\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 模型侧\n        R[rank] --- AL[alpha]\n        TM[target_modules] --- DO[dropout]\n    end\n    subgraph 优化器侧\n        LR[学习率] --- SC[调度器]\n        WR[warmup_ratio] --- WD[weight_decay]\n    end\n    subgraph 训练侧\n        BS[batch_size] --- GA[gradient_accumulation]\n        EP[epochs] --- ML[max_seq_length]\n    end\n    R --&gt;|rank↑ → LR 可适当↓| LR\n    BS --&gt;|BS↑ → LR 应适当↑| LR\n    EP --&gt;|EP↑ → 过拟合风险↑| DO</pre><h2 id=\"2026-年推荐配置表\">2026 年推荐配置表</h2><p>基于 Lightning AI、Sebastian Raschka、Unsloth 团队的大规模实验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>rank (r)</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>8-64</td>\n<td>任务越复杂越大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>alpha</td>\n<td>2r</td>\n<td>r-4r</td>\n<td>rsLoRA 建议 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha/\\sqrt{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>learning_rate</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\times10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\times10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>LoRA 比全量微调高 5-10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lr_scheduler</td>\n<td>cosine</td>\n<td>cosine/linear</td>\n<td>cosine 几乎总是最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>warmup_ratio</td>\n<td>0.03-0.1</td>\n<td>0.01-0.15</td>\n<td>数据少时 warmup 占比大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch_size (effective)</td>\n<td>16-64</td>\n<td>8-128</td>\n<td>通过 gradient_accumulation 凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>epochs</td>\n<td>1-3</td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>&gt;3 几乎必然过拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>weight_decay</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>0-0.1</td>\n<td>LoRA 中作用有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>max_seq_length</td>\n<td>2048-4096</td>\n<td>512-32768</td>\n<td>覆盖数据分布的 95 分位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lora_dropout</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>0-0.1</td>\n<td>数据少时增大到 0.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习率-最敏感的超参数\">学习率：最敏感的超参数</h2><p>学习率选择的经验法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>LR</mtext><mtext>LoRA</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>LR</mtext><mtext>full_ft</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LR}_{\\text{LoRA}} \\approx 5\\text{-}10 \\times \\text{LR}_{\\text{full\\_ft}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LoRA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full_ft</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>LoRA 的梯度经过低秩瓶颈后幅度变小，需要更高的学习率补偿。过低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;5\\times10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）几乎不学习，过高（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;1\\times10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）则梯度爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>学习率与 batch size 的 scaling law</strong>：线性缩放规则（linear scaling rule）在 LLM 微调中近似成立——effective batch size 翻倍时，学习率也应翻倍。但这一规则在 batch size &gt; 128 时开始失效。</p>\n<p><strong>Warmup 的必要性</strong>：微调开始时模型处于预训练权重的局部最优附近，突然施加大梯度会将其弹出好的 basin。warmup 让模型在前几步&quot;轻柔地&quot;开始适应新数据。经验值：总步数的 3-10%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rank-与任务复杂度的关系\">Rank 与任务复杂度的关系</h2><p>直觉上 rank 越大越好，但实际存在收益递减点。原因是：超过有效内在维度后，多余的 rank 只是在拟合噪声。</p>\n<p>Raschka 2024 年的系统实验结论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>rank 从 4 到 16：性能显著提升</li>\n<li>rank 从 16 到 64：边际提升逐渐缩小</li>\n<li>rank 从 64 到 256：几乎无提升，反而训练变慢且显存增加</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实用判断</strong>：如果 rank=16 和 rank=64 的验证集 loss 差距 &lt;2%，选 rank=16 更划算（训练快 3-4 倍）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"避免过拟合的策略\">避免过拟合的策略</h2><p>微调数据集通常较小（500-10000 条），过拟合是首要风险：</p>\n<p><strong>早停（Early Stopping）</strong>——监控验证集 loss，连续 N 步不下降即停止。通常 SFT 任务 1-2 epoch 后验证 loss 就开始上升。</p>\n<p><strong>数据增强</strong>——对指令部分做同义改写、对回答部分做格式变体，增加训练集的有效多样性。</p>\n<p><strong>NEFTune</strong>——在训练时向 embedding 层注入均匀噪声（幅度 5-15），已被 Unsloth 和 TRL 默认支持。平均提升 2-5 个点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>e</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Uniform</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{e} = e + \\frac{\\alpha}{\\sqrt{L \\cdot d}} \\cdot \\text{Uniform}(-1, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0376em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1778em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Uniform</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"调参流程\">调参流程</h2><p>实际项目中的推荐调参顺序（重要性递减）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>学习率</strong>：先在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{5\\times10^{-5}, 1\\times10^{-4}, 2\\times10^{-4}, 5\\times10^{-4}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 中快速跑 100 步看 loss 曲线</li>\n<li><strong>epoch 数</strong>：用最优 LR 训练，找到验证 loss 最低点对应的 epoch</li>\n<li><strong>rank</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{8, 16, 32\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 中对比最终评估分数</li>\n<li><strong>其余参数</strong>：使用推荐默认值，只在以上三步后仍不满意时微调</li>\n</ol>\n<p>切忌做大规模网格搜索——LLM 微调的单次实验成本使得暴力搜索不现实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>学习率是最敏感超参数：LoRA 微调典型值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，约为全量微调的 5-10 倍</li>\n<li>rank 选择遵循收益递减规律：16 覆盖多数场景，复杂任务上探 32-64</li>\n<li>epoch 数控制在 1-3，超过 3 几乎必然过拟合小数据集</li>\n<li>NEFTune embedding 噪声是低成本的正则化手段</li>\n<li>推荐调参顺序：学习率 → epoch → rank → 其余</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"evaluation-metrics\">评估指标与对比实验</a>——超参调优需要可靠的评估指标来判断&quot;哪组更好&quot;</li>\n<li><a href=\"../methods/lora-qlora\">LoRA 与 QLoRA 低秩适配</a>——理解 rank/alpha 背后的数学原理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超参数调优策略","id":"超参数调优策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年推荐配置表","id":"2026-年推荐配置表"},{"level":2,"text":"学习率：最敏感的超参数","id":"学习率-最敏感的超参数"},{"level":2,"text":"Rank 与任务复杂度的关系","id":"rank-与任务复杂度的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"避免过拟合的策略","id":"避免过拟合的策略"},{"level":2,"text":"调参流程","id":"调参流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"微调数据工程与合成数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation/training-data-engineering"},"next":{"title":"评估指标与对比实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation/evaluation-metrics"}}